Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's not following me... Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:14.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I can't even eat my lunch in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:17.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Every free second I get, \Nit's like he's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:22.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Damn it! The cut from my kidney \Ntransplant only just closed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,My stomach and stress are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:27.62,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's seriously got some nerve to \Nbe able to tell the same chick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:29.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,he told to go sell her body \Nthat he loves her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:34.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's always smiling, so it's impossible \Nto tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.22,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.29,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,H-How'd you find me here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:43.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I think it's my love for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:46.24,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No matter where you are, I instantly know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:47.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.19,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm kidding. Though I'm serious \Nabout the fact that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Uh, could you seriously stop with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:56.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sorry, my bad. The real \Nanswer's inside your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Your electronic dictionary...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I crammed a GPS module in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:04.90,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:08.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Man, it's great knowing exactly \Nwhere you are so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:09.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:11.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You tryin' to pick a fight with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:18.37,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The idea was to confess before \Nyou found out and got mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.85,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Did you get mad anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:25.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If this don't look mad to you, better trade \Nin yer eyeballs at the optometrist!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.13,0:01:31.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I admit to installing the GPS, but I actually \Nhad something I needed to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:37.48,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We've actually gotta be at the house tonight, \Ntogether, without going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:40.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The old man has something \Nto discuss with us, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:15.96,Signs_EpTitle,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H98C0C7&}Let Me Express My Sincerity, and Maybe Earn\NYour Affection in the Process
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:20.78,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What's this supposed to be about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:24.03,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A few too many things come to mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:24.43,Signs,Background signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)\fnGeorgia\c&HF1F0F3&\pos(462.5,59.5)}Organ\NSelling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.43,Signs,Background signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,1)\fnGeorgia\c&HF1F0F3&\pos(79,83)}Classmates\NBullying
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:28.16,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's not going to be a big deal. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:38.39,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,The boss has business that \Nhe can't get away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.90,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,So I'm handling this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:42.28,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino, I think this is your \Nfirst time meeting them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,This is Tachibana-san and Inamori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:45.78,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:48.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I know how he looks, \Nbut Tachibana-san's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:50.74,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,You wanna die, you little shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:53.28,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,I'm only saying this once, \Nso stay quiet and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.63,0:03:55.29,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,That goes double for you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:04:00.79,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,This is recent news, but the daughter of \NAkaza Enterprises's president has gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.05,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A-Akaza Enterprises...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:05.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,A third-string Tokusa Clan affiliate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs22\c&H000202&\3c&HF5F8F5&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(559,27)}Tokusa Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\an7\fs20\c&HF3F8F7&\3c&H09070B&\bord1.2\blur0.5\pos(560,16)\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m -70 174 l 70 174 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,91)}1st Tier\N(Main Family)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\an7\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,93)\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m -30 20 l -30 19 30 19 30 20
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,118.5)}2nd Tier Groups\N(Miyama Family etc.)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\an7\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,120)\fscx150\fscy100\p1}m -30 20 l -30 19 30 19 30 20
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560.5,144.5)}3rd Tier Groups\N(Akaza Enterprises etc.)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\an7\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,146)\fscx191\fscy100\p1}m -30 20 l -30 19 30 19 30 20
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs8\c&H010101&\pos(560,173.5)}4th Tier Groups
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:10.81,Signs,Pyramid signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,1)\fs10\c&H000202&\3c&HF5F8F5&\bord1.5\blur0.5\pos(560,193)}Et cetera
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:07.54,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Basically, third from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:10.80,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you're aware, \Nwe're second from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.59,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,This girl was roughly the \Nsame age as you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:17.97,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Maybe she just ran away from home, \Nor maybe someone grabbed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.81,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Which wouldn't normally be a \Nbig deal, except right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:23.32,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,we've got a similar girl on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:28.32,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,If anything happens, there'll be \Nhell to pay. Somei Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:33.58,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,For now, until President Akaza's \Ndaughter has been found,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:36.84,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,you need to be with Kirishima 24 hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.40,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,And if that's no good, make use of Inamori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.09,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:43.53,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:46.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Good to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.58,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:53.20,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Twenty-four hours a day with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:57.04,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Even odds are I snap and kill this dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:59.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:01.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,N-No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.99,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I guess I'm going to have to stay \Ninside the house for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:12.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I actually made reservations so \Nwe could go out and have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:14.32,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Did you listen to a single thing they—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You worry too much, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:17.49,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's part of your charm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:23.21,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I really doubt this has anything \Nto do with us, in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you know something about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:28.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about you join me for dinner, \Nand I spill the beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.71,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I let him talk me into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:36.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What am I looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.91,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's deep-fried hasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,H-Hasu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:41.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's lotus root.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Lotus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:48.02,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,They call lotus "hasu"? \NSounds kinda Tokyo-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:53.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's good. Has a soy-sauce flavor to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:57.79,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Was just thinking how cute you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:05.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Look, given the situation... \NWhat exactly about me do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:12.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, if you honestly think there's \Nany chance I could fall for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,you probably have flowers growing \Nwhere you oughta have brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:21.15,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're right! I love everything about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.98,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but I especially love how \Nyou say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.44,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You can have mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:29.95,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't get it... \NHe's being as polite as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:33.25,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but it sure doesn't feel \Nany less threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.87,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:36.83,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:43.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(405,1312)\fnArial Black\c&H342B2A&\pos(190.5,119.5)}Virgin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:43.21,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No one has ever said they liked me before, \Nso I've got no basis for comparison!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:45.78,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, I just remembered my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:49.32,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Here's what's up with President \NAkazawa's missing daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:54.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Akazawa Shiori, 20 years old. \NAttends a junior college in Kanagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:57.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Her arm... Are those real tattoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.78,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe not the smartest move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:03.28,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But she's got no police record.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:09.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I had chat with her two years ago, at the \Nfuneral for a consultant to the main family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:13.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She was a pretty typical spoiled rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:16.95,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You really don't know where she's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.12,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, she either ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:24.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,or got snatched by some punk and sold off \Nfor a couple of hundred thousand yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:26.11,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,My money's on one of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That ain't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:32.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Especially considering the \Nsituation you and I are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The same thing could happen \Nto us, you realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.42,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:42.47,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Unlike with you and your grandfather, \NI'm not Patriarch Miyama's grandson by blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:46.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He decided not to have any kids, \Nmeaning no grandkids either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:51.04,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He's actually my grandfather's older \Nbrother—my granduncle, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:53.98,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But when I was twelve, I imposed on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:56.23,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You... imposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You {\i1}wanted{\i0} to become a yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:04.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Of course not. He was just where I ended up \Nat the end of my line of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.87,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sorry. I gotta get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.49,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,At twelve years old...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:21.56,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How the hell does a kid like that end up \Nmaking himself at home with the yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:25.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:30.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, the thing is, they found one \Nof Akaza Enterprises's guys dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.85,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Something's afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:38.29,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The body belonged to an associate \Nmember of Akazaka Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:42.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He started out as a host and ended up running \Na handful of restaurants around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:44.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Can I point something out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.28,0:08:47.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're sitting there like you belong, \Nbut that's not your desk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're not even in this class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:53.61,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Anyway, turns out he was running \Nsome underground gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:54.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you listening, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:58.01,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,In particular, he was running gaming rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:08:59.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Rooms...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The idea is, you rent out some apartments,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and leave out baccarat tables \Nor whatever for people to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:08.91,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And it seems our Akaza girl was \Na regular at one of those rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.80,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Our stiff and Akaza Shiori \Nused to gamble together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:16.31,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and she was how he got the \Nintroduction into the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:19.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How do you know all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:20.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:23.30,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you gonna tell me if I say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:25.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Then how 'bout I strangle you instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:33.09,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Look, I'm pretty much ignorant to what \Ngoes on outside of Tokusa Clan turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:35.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh? Turf...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:37.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's like... \NWhen you're walking around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.33,0:09:40.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,from this street and beyond \Nis this group's turf,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.74,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,while in the other direction, \Nit belongs to a different family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:46.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Never really thought about it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:49.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, your guys pretty much \Nrun Osaka, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:54.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,435)\fs19\fnTimes New Roman\c&H31302C&\pos(466,8)\3c&HE9ECEA&\bord2}Territorial Quagmire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:54.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,435)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H31302C&\3c&HE9ECEA&\bord2\pos(507.5,71)}Ishiro Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:54.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,435)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H31302C&\3c&HE9ECEA&\bord2\pos(447.5,114.5)}Tokusa Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:54.57,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,435)\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H31302C&\3c&HE9ECEA&\bord2\pos(486.5,159)}Katabami Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:52.51,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But in Tokyo, about seventy percent \Nbelongs to the Tokusa Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.47,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,with the rest belonging to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:58.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And it's been a hundred-year bloody \Nstalemate between us and the other guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:02.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You think that's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:06.87,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I really hate to ask you \Nto help me out like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:10.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I forgot that the power frequency \Nbetween Tokyo and Osaka was different,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:13.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and I brought a really ancient \Nhairdryer with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:19.63,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,No, if anything we should've had \Nappliances prepared for you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:23.64,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's the first normal, nice person \NI've met in Tokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:29.15,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Kirishima-san was disappointed he wasn't \Nable to join us because of the sudden funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:31.41,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,You and he seem to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:33.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:36.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't understand \Nmost of what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.89,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Well, if we're being honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:42.16,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever had a \Nproper conversation with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:44.04,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:48.78,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,When I first met him, Kirishima-san \Nwas still in middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:51.96,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,but he sure didn't seem like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:54.54,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,And it's never gotten any \Neasier to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.47,0:10:57.44,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:02.17,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,he said that he imposed on the Miyama \NFamily when he was twelve years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.54,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,This is just what I was told,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:11.55,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,but Kirishima-san caused a pretty major \Nviolent incident when he was in fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:17.81,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,It was a big enough deal that his parents \Nweren't able to handle it on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:23.33,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,so the boss took care of it, and that's \Nhow he ended up with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:25.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-When you say violent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:29.51,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,There were 20 other kids altogether, \Nboth classmates and older students.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:31.86,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Snapped bones all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Snapped bones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:38.92,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Er, I mean, this is all just hearsay, \Nso who knows, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:42.59,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Sorry, I shouldn't have mentioned it. \NJust forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:49.34,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Ugh, traffic is so bad \Naround this time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:54.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.45,Flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Akaza Shiori, 20 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I-Is that Akaza...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shiori?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:08.45,Default,Kriishima,0,0,0,,Hello. What's up? Rare of you to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:10.45,Default,Kriishima,0,0,0,,Did you get your new hairdryer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:14.56,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did. Can you talk right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:19.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You see, uh... I think I just saw a girl \Nresembling President Akaza's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.80,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She had the same tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:25.11,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Looks like her being "missing" \Nwas a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:30.36,DefaultItalics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,On top of that, her old man's \Nbeen hard to track down lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:33.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I bet they're both trying to lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.57,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,They're both hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:37.86,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why would they do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.36,DefaultItalics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,More importantly, do you \Nknow where you saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.13,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Nox Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:46.41,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She just had to make it awkward...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:49.79,DefaultItalics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's a pretty famous club, right? \NHow's it awkward?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.63,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's not on our turf. \NIt belongs to the Kirigaya-gumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:57.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, Kirigaya-gumi?! \NThat's one of my family's!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:01.38,DefaultItalics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yep. Which means our guys wouldn't \Nbe seen wandering around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Pretty clever trick, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:06.38,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm not technically with the family, \Nso I could go...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:09.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait, are you going to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.84,DefaultItalics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.80,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How about you don't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:16.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I might be totally wrong, and besides, \Nwhy would {\i1}you{\i0} need to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.38,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:22.15,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Clubs don't let people bring in the real \Ndangerous stuff, so I doubt I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:26.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Do you not understand the concept \Nof avoiding danger in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:33.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Fine. I'm gonna put in a call to the \Nfamily office about wanting to drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:38.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,They'll probably let us both in if it's a \Nrequest from Boss Somei's granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.49,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If you wanted to party, \NI could've shown you to—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:46.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's my fault for telling you \Nin the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:48.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'll see you there. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:55.00,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,This could end up complicating \Nthings for that one deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:57.93,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Should me and a few of the \Nyounger guys go with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.42,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:05.09,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,If he screws up, then he \Njust has to take responsibility for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.40,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,And if he dies, then he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:14.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Too loud! What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:18.70,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Damn it, I would've been happy going my whole \Nlife without stepping into a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:22.62,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell?! Their parents would cry \Nif they saw 'em doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:24.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're not gonna see a lot \Nof families around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:28.46,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, Yoshino, \Nso stick close to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:31.98,Default,Friend 1,0,0,0,,Shiori, you're going \Noverseas tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:34.46,Default,Friend 1,0,0,0,,Should you be drinking in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:38.03,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm not even gonna be able to \Ncome back to Japan for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:40.96,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,My dad worries too much, \Nand it's so obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:44.22,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm fed up with having people \Nwatch me all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.39,Default,Friend 2,0,0,0,,What did you even do, Shiori?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:50.31,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,She was cheating at the baccarat \Ntables with the dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:51.94,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Against the Filipino mafia, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:53.74,Default,Friends,0,0,0,,The mafia?! Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:57.31,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,You took them for 500 mill. \NHow stupid are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:59.22,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,You saw what happened \Nto the other guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:02.38,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's why I paid you guys for protection, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:06.43,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,All I even did was invite those \Nrich old dudes to gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.64,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,The cheating wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:11.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Five hundred mill, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.65,0:15:13.79,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sounds like you had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:16.15,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Good to see you again, Akaza Shiori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.13,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:20.40,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Aw, you don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:23.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We met at Captain Kashiwagi's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm Miyama Gaku's grandson, \NMiyama Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,H-Hi there. I'm Somei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:31.04,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Huh? Miyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:33.78,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,Hey, Shiori, do you seriously know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.69,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,N-Never seen him in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:38.91,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know who sent you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.79,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,but do you think can kill me on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.75,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? I've got no reason \Nto kill you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:50.42,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The only people who do are probably \Nthe Filipino mob, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:54.42,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Makes me wonder where \NPresident Akaza ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:57.20,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He's gotta be terrified...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:03.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What with his daughter ripping off a Filipino \Ncrime syndicate for a cool half billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:04.93,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:10.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about you cancel your overseas trip \Ntomorrow and join me at our office instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:11.44,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:17.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If you and your father keep this up, \Nit's gonna get past the point of no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:20.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm sure you realize the trouble you're \Ncausing for the main family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:26.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,President Akaza made the \Nright move going to ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:29.79,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but at this rate, he's gonna find himself \Nstuck between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.62,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:39.41,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Hey, you assholes, \Nwhat the hell am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:41.60,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Is this some kinda social club?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:44.10,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,We were just waiting for you to show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:47.11,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Shut up. All this for one punk kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.90,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Let's take care of it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:52.16,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,Screw you! We might let \Nyou off this time, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.49,Default,Punk 1,0,0,0,,You son of a—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What the hell did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.66,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Something about letting someone off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:08.67,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, no, none of you are \Ngetting out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:10.68,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Who the hell—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:14.54,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:19.55,Default,Punk 3,0,0,0,,You little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.15,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Damn, that friggin' hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.88,Flashback,Inamori,0,0,0,,There were 20 other kids altogether, \Nboth classmates and older students.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:32.44,Flashback,Inamori,0,0,0,,Snapped bones all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:36.69,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, I buy it. This guy's more than capable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:40.81,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How can he hit someone with \Nall his strength like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.71,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,How is he so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.71,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.95,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm just weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:50.69,DefaultItalics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And I ain't gonna back down \Nin this mess, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.35,Default,Shimoda,0,0,0,,Damn it! You son of a—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:05.20,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Die, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:11.80,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,You bi—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:17.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What the hell are you \Nscreaming for, dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:20.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No one wants to hear it! How about you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:26.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shit, I broke the hairdryer. \NIt ain't foldin' anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.19,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino, you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:31.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's just a bloody nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:34.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I should mention you've got \Nsomethin' stuck in yer leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:40.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up. You don't get to sleep, \Nnot after making Yoshino bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Uh, he ain't hearin' anythin' now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:46.60,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Kill you... I'll kill... dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:48.80,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aw, but I hit him twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:54.37,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're not killing anyone. \NYou made my girl bleed, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You don't even get to die, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:19:00.38,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I want another ten liters of blood \Nfrom you before I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:09.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Knock it off! What's yer problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:12.66,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What kinda maniac kills somebody \Nover a single hit, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:15.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But you told him to die before...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:18.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Killin' off trash like this \Nain't even worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:20.75,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But you're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:24.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This ain't from when I got hit. \NI fell and landed on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:25.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's such a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.56,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No, it ain't! And wait, \Nwhere'd Akaza Shiori go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.87,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Sh-She ain't dead... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:40.88,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Who cares if she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm too depressed to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:45.36,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, get a grip, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:49.58,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I guess President Akaza got away \Nwith just being expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:53.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(27,3739,\fscy82.91)\t(27,3739,\fscx82.91)\fs16\b0\fnArial\bord2\c&H484338&\3c&HEEEFEA&\frz37.06\fax0.35\move(191.5,111.5,159.25,92.92,27,3739)}News Updates
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:53.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(27,3739,\fscy82.91)\t(27,3739,\fscx82.91)\fs16\b0\fnArial\bord2\c&H484338&\3c&HEEEFEA&\frz37.06\fax0.35\move(273.14,108.77,226.94,90.66,27,3739)}Yakuza Families
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:53.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(27,3739,\fscy82.91)\t(27,3739,\fscx82.91)\fs16\b0\fnArial\bord2\c&H393A36&\3c&HEEEFEA&\fax0.2\move(482.14,241.77,400.21,200.93,27,3739)\frz44.13}Organized Crime News
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.12,0:19:52.09,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,More like exiled.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.09,0:19:56.96,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,His daughter isn't safe in Japan, \Nso she ended up heading overseas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I've gotta ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:03.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You seem more injured than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:07.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, I made a bunch of trouble on \NKirigaya-gumi turf, so I got a talking-to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:10.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Ten million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:16.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What did you do this time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:21.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,This is my cut of the 500 mill, as split \Nbetween the Filipino mafia and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:26.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,In exchange for finding the girl \Nand President Akaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:32.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,they decided to split the money \Ndown the middle and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:36.43,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And I found them, \Nso I get ten million to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Which is now yours, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:43.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Whoa, no way! I can't take this! \NThere's no reason for me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:46.80,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You literally gave me four mill the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:50.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I was thinking about selling \Na kidney to pay you back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.05,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but I didn't really have the right hookup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:56.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And I don't really know how to show that \NI'm being sincere other than with cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:21:01.57,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're talkin' about sincerity, but there's \Na lotta other stuff we gotta address here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:03.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I guess I could sell my corneas, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.73,0:21:07.32,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That'll only be 100 thou, \Nbut I know the right people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:10.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:14.09,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't need the money, or your corneas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:18.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What I need is a new hairdryer, \Nand you need to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Since I broke the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:24.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:56.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Where should we go after \Npicking up the hairdryer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:58.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.99,0:22:01.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Naw, after we buy it, I'm goin' straight home.
